{"message":"For your 3-month trip, the Bluest Account appears to be the best choice based on the available ATM benefits: it has no Rho-Bank fee for foreign ATM withdrawals and rebates eligible foreign ATM operator fees up to $50 per monthly statement cycle. Its daily ATM withdrawal limit is $1,500. Third-party ATM fees, currency-conversion charges, and fees above the monthly rebate cap may still apply.

For comparison, the Purple Account rebates ATM operator fees up to $30 per month, so Bluest provides up to $20 more in monthly ATM-fee coverage. When withdrawing abroad, choose checking at the ATM, select local currency rather than dynamic currency conversion, and keep receipts showing surcharges.

I can help open the Bluest Account. To begin the required identity verification, please provide your full name or the email address on your Rho-Bank profile. After I retrieve your information, I’ll ask you to confirm two identity details."}
